assisted natural regeneration ;
(b)
artificial regeneration ;
(c)
plant production ;
(d)
silvicultural operations in forests ;
(e)
protection and maintenance of plantations and forests ;
(f)
protection and maintenance of forest boundary ;
(g)
pest and disease control in forest ;
(h)
forest fire prevention and control operations ;
(i)
soil and moisture conservation works in the forest ;
(j)
