19.
Utilization of interest accrued on deposits in State Fund.
- The interest accrued on monies in the State Fund shall be used in the following manner :-
(a)
not less than sixty per cent of the interest transferred to the State Fund and further accrued on the amount available in
the State Fund referred to in sub rule (1) shall be spent on activities for the purpose of conservation and development of
